# Append-only journals: two runners (cloud routine, operator loop.sh) cycle on
# the same hours and both append. A union merge keeps both sides' rows instead
# of stopping the push. Files whose rows are UPDATED in place (ledger.jsonl,
# real-ledger.jsonl, forecasts.jsonl) and files that carry state (schedule,
# quota) are deliberately NOT here: a conflict there has to fail loudly.
journal/cycles.log merge=union
journal/watch-triggers.jsonl merge=union
